WEBVTT

00:00:04.280 --> 00:00:06.790
Chihaya-chan, pass me that cookie!

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.930
Haruka, where are your manners...

00:00:12.130 --> 00:00:13.250
That's right.

00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:16.500
We're here at "Vacation Island"!

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:19.700
This place is near my hometown!

00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:23.400
Wow... I wanna go to a resort, too...

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:26.640
The tea's ready, everyone.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.140
Waaai!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:32.780
I'm back!

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:35.090
Welcome back!

00:00:35.090 --> 00:00:38.180
Ahh, everyone's here today...

00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:39.320
Perfect!

00:00:39.890 --> 00:00:42.500
Oh! Is it settled, then?

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:44.000
Yeah!

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:48.520
Vacation Island Global Music Festival?

00:00:49.170 --> 00:00:51.320
Huh? This island is...

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:53.850
It's the place we just saw on TV!

00:00:54.190 --> 00:00:57.320
The island is full of attractions, including

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:00.980
an outdoor stage, a pool, a theme park...

00:01:02.100 --> 00:01:03.610
It sounds wonderful!

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:07.720
Ami and Mami wanna live out the rest of our days there!

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:09.170
Mmhmm!

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:12.420
But why are you showing us this?

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:15.360
Ahem...

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:20.490
Actually, 765 Pro have been officially invited to this music festival!

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:22.250
Huh!?

00:01:22.250 --> 00:01:24.740
Along with a 3-day, 2-night luxury trip!

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:25.860
But...

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:27.250
Alright!!

00:01:27.880 --> 00:01:29.870
A resort, I can't believe it!

00:01:29.870 --> 00:01:34.310
We'll be standing alongside singers
from around the world, what an honor!

00:01:36.990 --> 00:01:39.380
Let me sleep a bit more...

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:42.270
So when are we leaving?

00:01:42.270 --> 00:01:43.680
W... wait... H...HEY

00:01:43.680 --> 00:01:45.330
Wait, STOP!!

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.630
What I was about to say is...

00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:52.680
Not everyone is going to be able to go.

00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:54.380
Huhh!?

00:01:56.240 --> 00:02:01.100
So, the members who will be going are...

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:05.100
Jan...

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:05.520
ken...

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:06.240
pon!

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:07.480
Draw!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:08.520
Draw! Draw...

00:02:08.910 --> 00:02:12.840
Wow! It looks just like a map, Iori-chan!

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:15.910
f course it does... we're on an airplane...

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:19.350
This is like a field trip...

00:02:19.350 --> 00:02:20.220
Ehehe!

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:23.640
I haven't been on a trip since junior high, so I'm enjoying it!

00:02:24.030 --> 00:02:26.490
This is work, you know...

00:02:26.490 --> 00:02:28.370
I know!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:31.080
Would you like any... drinks...?

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.200
Producer?

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.050
Mm?

00:02:42.050 --> 00:02:45.090
After the plane, we're going on a boat, right?

00:02:45.090 --> 00:02:45.810
Yeah...

00:02:47.090 --> 00:02:51.390
Ehehe! It's like eating fried shrimp and
croquettes together, I'm so happy!!

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.430
Ahaha... that's great...

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:54.960
Hey, Nii-chan!

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:57.800
We can have some fun when we get there, right!?

00:02:58.370 --> 00:03:00.230
Have some fun...?

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:03.900
But we said we'd plan the show when we got to the island, right?

00:03:03.900 --> 00:03:06.600
Ahhh, not even just for today!?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:10.560
It's fine! We'll work hard, too!

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:12.810
But we don't have much time...

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:16.770
Oh, Nii-chan! You're so stubborn!!

00:03:16.770 --> 00:03:19.570
Mami and Ami are in the springtime of adolescence...

00:03:19.570 --> 00:03:21.690
Think about us, too!

00:03:21.690 --> 00:03:23.600
Look, Producer...

00:03:23.600 --> 00:03:29.380
The ever-increasingly-popular Super Idol Iori-chan is leading this unit, you know?

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:31.880
Huh? Really, Iori?

00:03:31.910 --> 00:03:34.020
Yes, really! Anyway...

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:37.800
As long as I'm here, success is certain!

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.370
So it'll be fine if we have a bit of fun!

00:03:40.370 --> 00:03:44.440
Huh? Iori-chan, didn't you say we were gonna have LOADS of fun today...

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.210
Wah! Hey, hey, hey...

00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.940
Hey, come on, Nii-chan!

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:49.820
Hmmm...

00:03:50.040 --> 00:03:52.430
Producer...

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.950
Alright, I'll trust you all!

00:03:55.690 --> 00:04:00.980
Just promise to look after each other, and make sure to work as well as play!

00:04:01.450 --> 00:04:03.460
Yes, sir!!

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.990
Hahah, this really is like a field trip...

00:04:21.330 --> 00:04:25.820
Wow, it's even more amazing than I'd imagined...

00:04:25.820 --> 00:04:27.150
Yayooooi!

00:04:27.150 --> 00:04:28.990
Oh, Chousuke!!

00:04:32.320 --> 00:04:34.550
It's been ages, how are you!?

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:36.010
Heeey! Have you all been good?

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:38.230
We've all been good!

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.580
Why are Yayoi's brothers and sisters here!?

00:04:41.580 --> 00:04:45.040
Nihihi... I invited them all!

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:49.540
I mean, if Yayoi's not with her
 family,  she can't sleep at night!

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:50.710
Iori...

00:04:50.710 --> 00:04:54.110
you've been planning all along to spend the whole of today having fun, haven't you!

00:04:54.610 --> 00:04:59.110
Don't worry! We'll work hard tomorrow! OK?

00:05:01.170 --> 00:05:06.860
Alright, everyone! Today we're gonna follow Iori's perfect plan, and have loads of fun!

00:05:06.860 --> 00:05:08.550
Yeah!!!

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:06.010
Today was a pretty tough day, wasn't it...

00:06:06.390 --> 00:06:10.180
It's not over yet! There's still the fireworks!

00:06:10.570 --> 00:06:12.840
Huh!? There's still more to come!?

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:14.470
What are you talking about?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:17.120
After the fireworks is the nighttime theme park!

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.190
That's our Iorin!

00:06:19.190 --> 00:06:20.930
The perfect plan!

00:06:20.930 --> 00:06:23.360
Come on, having fun's all well and good,

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:28.920
but tomorrow we're gonna be working hard to get the show perfect, you know!

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.340
Make sure that you don't tire yourselves out and sleep in too late tomorrow!

00:06:32.340 --> 00:06:39.980
We're fine. Superstar Iori-chan is here, so it'll all be fine! Right, Charles?

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:44.860
Is it really gonna be alright...?

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:02.280
Iorin's so late...

00:07:02.280 --> 00:07:05.780
Even Nii-chan woke up early, and he's an old man...

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:09.140
Who's an old man!? I'm still in my 20s!

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.030
Producer...

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.550
Shall I go and check Iori-chan's room?

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:17.610
Yeah, please. If she's any later than this,

00:07:17.610 --> 00:07:20.260
we won't be in time to meet with the staff...

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:21.840
Alright, lemme go and check!

00:07:21.850 --> 00:07:23.340
OK, thanks!

00:07:26.140 --> 00:07:29.170
Oh, Iori-chan! Good morning!

00:07:29.170 --> 00:07:31.470
Mm, good morning...

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:33.560
Huh?

00:07:34.020 --> 00:07:36.590
Ahh... Iorin, you're so late!!

00:07:36.590 --> 00:07:39.340
Yeah! Nii-chan's an old man, and he... huh?

00:07:41.080 --> 00:07:41.580
Hm?

00:07:46.920 --> 00:07:49.350
Iori-chan, is something wrong?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:53.410
Oh... i-it's nothing!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.270
I just haven't woken up properly yet.

00:07:56.270 --> 00:08:00.360
Sorry to keep you waiting. OK, let's go!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.870
One, two, three...

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.280
Ahh...

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:27.490
Iori-chan... what's wrong? Did something happen?

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.280
It's nothing.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.520
Anyway, today's the rehearsal,

00:08:31.520 --> 00:08:33.630
so you practice singing too, Yayoi!

00:08:34.390 --> 00:08:36.520
Iori-chan, you're lying, aren't you!

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:43.500
I can tell when you're lying, Iori-chan!

00:08:50.130 --> 00:08:52.840
Ya-Yayoicchi, what's wrong?

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.300
This is kinda scary...

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:59.590
Come on, Iori, what happened? Something's wrong...

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.320
Iori-chan, what happened to Charles!?

00:09:02.600 --> 00:09:03.220
Oh...

00:09:03.220 --> 00:09:04.350
Oh...

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.050
Oh yeah...

00:09:06.050 --> 00:09:07.800
I didn't bring him with me...

00:09:10.390 --> 00:09:14.770
Alright, we promised to practice today...So let's practice!

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.110
No, Iori-chan!

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:21.210
You're just gonna hurt yourself
 if you try and practice like this!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:27.210
Come on, Iori, tell us what's really wrong...

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.440
I can't find him...

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.330
I can't find him...

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:39.250
He was with me yesterday at the fireworks...

00:09:40.270 --> 00:09:44.060
But after we got back from the town...

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.500
I fell asleep in the same room as everyone...

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:51.280
So I have no idea when he disappeared...

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:52.580
Ahhh...

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.010
I-iorin...

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:57.550
Ahh, I see...

00:09:57.550 --> 00:09:59.530
I'll go and look!

00:09:59.530 --> 00:10:03.420
No! It's me who said we should have fun yesterday!

00:10:03.800 --> 00:10:07.110
If we don't work today, we're not professionals...

00:10:09.570 --> 00:10:13.390
When my pets run away, I keep searching for them, no matter how long it takes!

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:17.900
If it's important to you, you have to look!!

00:10:19.470 --> 00:10:21.830
Nii-chan! Ami and the others will look, too!

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:23.030
Oh, uh...

00:10:25.610 --> 00:10:26.610
Yayoi!?

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.900
I'll ask Chousuke and the others to look, too!

00:10:30.900 --> 00:10:33.910
If everybody helps to look for him, then we'll find him sooner!If we all look, we'll find him that bit sooner!

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:36.940
Alright, I'll go too!

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:37.820
Ami will go too!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:41.000
Iorin, you rest here!

00:10:41.000 --> 00:10:43.920
Iori, let's go with them.

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:46.950
Before anything else, we gotta stop you worrying!

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:53.030
Oh... they're all so stupid...

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:43.480
Thank you, everyone...

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:45.990
Let's go back to the stage.

00:11:46.480 --> 00:11:50.980
Iori-chan!? We can't, I'm sure we'll find him!

00:11:53.050 --> 00:11:56.200
Yeah, you're right, so let's go back to the stage.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:01.390
While we were looking, I was thinking...

00:12:01.390 --> 00:12:05.450
About why Charles disappeared...

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:09.740
Then I realized...

00:12:09.740 --> 00:12:11.560
this festival is so important...

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:14.750
And all I was thinking about was having fun...

00:12:14.750 --> 00:12:16.730
Maybe he's punishing me for not taking it seriously...

00:12:17.740 --> 00:12:20.940
So, it might be too late, but...

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:24.240
I want to work really hard for the festival!

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.390
It's not too late!

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:31.020
Iori-chan, I'll work really hard, too!

00:12:34.340 --> 00:12:37.720
Yeah, let's! If we do, I'm sure...

00:12:42.210 --> 00:12:45.270
Charles... if you're there, reply!

00:12:46.540 --> 00:12:49.820
Ahh... that's not gonna work, Ganaha-san...

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:55.010
Ahhh, if only he'd just fall out of the sky...

00:12:59.100 --> 00:13:00.740
Wahhhhh!?

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:05.230
Here, Iorin.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:11.620
Charles... welcome back...

00:13:12.250 --> 00:13:14.870
She said she found him in the hotel hall!

00:13:14.870 --> 00:13:16.900
I'm so glad we found him!

00:13:16.900 --> 00:13:19.610
Geez, that pesky rabbit!

00:13:20.180 --> 00:13:22.140
Thank goodness, Iori-chan!

00:13:23.230 --> 00:13:25.710
Thank you, everyone...!

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:28.140
And... I'm sorry...

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:32.710
I've used up our precious time at the music festival...

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:36.150
It's fine. If we put our heads together, we'll make it!

00:13:36.620 --> 00:13:38.220
Yup!

00:13:38.220 --> 00:13:39.080
Iori-chan!

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:43.580
Let's go back to the stage and plan our performance!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:46.400
Alright!! Let's do it!

00:13:44.020 --> 00:13:46.410
I wonder what kind of show we'll do...

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:47.570
Hmm... I wonder...

00:13:48.220 --> 00:13:50.990
Kasumi-chan and all of you guys, too...

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:53.710
I'm so sorry for using up your holiday time.

00:13:55.480 --> 00:14:00.050
No, I got to go to lots of places today, and had lots of fun!

00:14:00.050 --> 00:14:02.900
Me too!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.720
Me too!

00:14:05.370 --> 00:14:07.320
Like an adventure, eh...

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:09.410
Fun, eh...

00:14:09.410 --> 00:14:10.310
Ah!

00:14:10.310 --> 00:14:12.960
Th-that's it! Our song is...

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:14.830
What is it?

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:18.290
Heheheh! I understand, too!

00:14:18.300 --> 00:14:20.510
That's great, Iorin! Let's go with that!

00:14:21.200 --> 00:14:25.110
Shindou! Prepare the costumes! Hurry!

00:14:25.600 --> 00:14:28.660
Yes, Miss Iori.

00:14:29.070 --> 00:14:30.320
Producer!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:34.980
The genius Iori-chan and her friends are here, tomorrow'll be perfect!

00:14:34.980 --> 00:14:36.020
Y-yeah...

00:14:36.040 --> 00:14:38.570
Ehehe! It's sort of thanks to Kasumi and the others!

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:39.660
Ehehe!

00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:43.210
Uu-uuu! Alright, let's all do our best!

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:46.930
High Touch! Yay!

00:17:05.330 --> 00:17:10.740
I see. After running around everywhere for two days, they worked all that into the show.

00:17:11.520 --> 00:17:14.250
Every cloud has a silver lining, huh!

00:17:15.500 --> 00:17:19.980
That was an amazing show. Right, Charles?

00:17:19.980 --> 00:17:22.490
Producer-san!

00:17:24.110 --> 00:17:28.120
Ha-Haruka!? Wait... everyone!?

00:17:28.120 --> 00:17:35.500
With Charles held in your arms, you looked truly adorable, Producer.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:41.250
Oh, I-I'm just holding this for her...

00:17:41.250 --> 00:17:42.510
They got me...

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:45.250
Producer... Oh!

00:17:46.760 --> 00:17:48.980
You were all amazing!!

00:17:49.450 --> 00:17:50.620
Really?!

00:17:50.620 --> 00:17:51.540
Alright!

00:17:52.100 --> 00:17:53.380
I was so moved!

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:56.460
Uu-uuu! I'm so happy!

00:18:04.160 --> 00:18:06.290
Compared to when we all met,

00:18:06.290 --> 00:18:09.470
I think maybe everyone's grown up a little...

00:18:11.600 --> 00:18:13.200
Right, Charles?

00:18:21.090 --> 00:18:24.060
I was so surprised, though!

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:28.950
Hehe, everyone wanted to come and support the others, so here we are!

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:34.120
Hoho... if there's a party going on, I thought that everyone should be here!

00:18:34.120 --> 00:18:37.590
Thank you, President, Otonashi-san...

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:39.430
Thank you for waiting!

00:18:39.850 --> 00:18:44.190
Now, let's ask everyone at 765 Pro for an encore!

00:18:44.200 --> 00:18:45.880
Encore!

00:18:45.880 --> 00:18:48.910
Encore! Encore! Encore!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.600
Alright, get ready to go on stage, quickly...

00:18:52.600 --> 00:18:54.880
Umm, Producer...

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.910
We all thought about it, and...

00:18:59.220 --> 00:19:02.100
We'd all like to sing together at the end!

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:06.240
I see... what a good idea!

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:08.760
Nihihi... you're coming on too, you know!

00:19:08.760 --> 00:19:09.260
Huh?

00:19:09.460 --> 00:19:11.480
Piyo-chan, too!!

00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:12.580
Huhh??

00:19:12.600 --> 00:19:14.560
And you, President!

00:19:14.560 --> 00:19:15.600
Me too?

00:19:16.060 --> 00:19:19.340
Uu-uuu! Let's all sing together!

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:21.490
Come on, Producer-san!

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:36.890
OK, let's go! To our world of music!
